# Nosegrab: charged ollie, L + up held about a third of a second, let go before the
# landing (grab review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/grabs.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap grab+up 96
hold grab 97..140
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Nosegrab} within 120..200
expect no event bail
